    "context": "Before: immersions into $\\mathbb{R}^5$ (Gromov), embeddings into $\\mathbb{R}^{17}$ (Nash)",
    "stamp": "proved",
    "note": "An immersion, not an embedding: the surface may cross itself"
  },
